    "scope": "Windows64 WindowsDirectorySync mapping: DWORD/BOOL32, HANDLE64, WCHAR16; FileAttributeTagInfo8 and FileIdInfo24. Native C signature/layout and directory experiment precede isolated Java binding tests. Mechanism only; no volume flush, privilege adjustment or power-loss recovery claim. Native-first filesystem-profile experiment and Java binding also audit GetFinalPathNameByHandleW (DWORD, WCHAR units) and GetDriveTypeW (UINT32), comparing GUID-root identity with the opened directory. Java snapshot now retains the GUID root and drive type with root/opened-directory volume identity agreement. Full Host admission remains separate.",
